<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Laurel — Career Intelligence</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght,SOFT@9..144,300..700,0..100&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --wine-deep:#12090A;
    --wine-sec:#1C0C0D;
    --gold-royal:#D99A16;
    --gold-champagne:#F4C64E;
    --gold-antique:#A96708;
    --crimson-deep:#8F0D15;
    --crimson-ruby:#C71924;
    --ivory-warm:#FFF8E8;
    --ivory-muted:#CFC1A5;
    --gold-border: rgba(217,154,22,0.20);
    --gold-border-strong: rgba(217,154,22,0.38);
  }

  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}

  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

  body{
    background:var(--wine-deep);
    color:var(--ivory-warm);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    line-height:1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }

  h1,h2,h3,.display{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    color:var(--ivory-warm);
  }

  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}

  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}

  /* ---------- background texture ---------- */
  .texture-layer{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    z-index:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 900px 600px at 82% -6%, rgba(217,154,22,0.10), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 700px 500px at 8% 18%, rgba(143,13,21,0.10), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(var(--wine-deep), var(--wine-sec) 60%, var(--wine-deep));
  }
  .grid-lines{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    z-index:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    opacity:0.05;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(to right, var(--gold-royal) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--gold-royal) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 64px 64px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 20%, black, transparent);
  }

  main, header, footer{position:relative; z-index:1;}

  /* ---------- header ---------- */
  header{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:26px 32px;
    max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
  .brand svg{width:34px;height:34px;display:block;}
  .brand-name{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-size:1.28rem;
    font-weight:500;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
    color:var(--ivory-warm);
  }
  nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:32px;}
  .nav-links a{
    font-size:0.92rem;
    color:var(--ivory-muted);
    transition:color .25s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--gold-champagne);}

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    padding:13px 26px;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    font-weight:500;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;
    cursor:pointer;
    border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:transform .2s ease, box-shadow .3s ease, background .3s ease;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold-antique),var(--gold-champagne));
    color:var(--wine-deep);
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{
    transform:translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow:0 10px 30px -8px rgba(217,154,22,0.55);
  }
  .btn-primary .arrow{transition:transform .25s ease;}
  .btn-primary:hover .arrow{transform:translateX(3px);}

  .btn-secondary{
    background:rgba(255,248,232,0.02);
    border:1px solid var(--gold-border-strong);
    color:var(--ivory-warm);
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover{
    border-color:var(--gold-royal);
    background:rgba(217,154,22,0.06);
  }

  .btn-sm{padding:10px 20px;font-size:0.88rem;}

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:64px 32px 40px;
    max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap:56px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    color:var(--ivory-muted);
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow .dot{
    width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--gold-champagne);
    box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(244,198,78,0.7);
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:3.4rem;
    line-height:1.08;
    max-width:600px;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--gold-champagne);
  }
  .hero p.sub{
    font-size:1.1rem;
    color:var(--ivory-muted);
    max-width:480px;
    margin-bottom:36px;
  }
  .hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-bottom:52px;}

  .proof-row{
    display:flex;gap:40px;
    padding-top:28px;
    border-top:1px solid rgba(207,193,165,0.15);
    max-width:520px;
  }
  .proof-row div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;}
  .proof-num{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-size:1.6rem;
    color:var(--gold-champagne);
  }
  .proof-label{font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--ivory-muted);}

  /* ---------- hero visual: score ring ---------- */
  .hero-visual{
    position:relative;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  .score-panel{
    position:relative;
    width:100%;
    max-width:420px;
    aspect-ratio:1/1;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  .orbit-ring{
    position:absolute;
    border:1px solid rgba(217,154,22,0.14);
    border-radius:50%;
  }
  .orbit-ring.r1{inset:0;}
  .orbit-ring.r2{inset:34px; border-style:dashed; border-color:rgba(207,193,165,0.12);}

  .orbit-tag{
    position:absolute;
    background:var(--wine-sec);
    border:1px solid var(--gold-border);
    border-radius:7px;
    padding:7px 12px;
    font-size:0.76rem;
    color:var(--ivory-muted);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .orbit-tag .tag-dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;}
  .orbit-tag.t-resume{top:2%; left:8%;}
  .orbit-tag.t-resume .tag-dot{background:var(--gold-champagne);}
  .orbit-tag.t-skills{top:14%; right:-2%;}
  .orbit-tag.t-skills .tag-dot{background:var(--crimson-ruby);}
  .orbit-tag.t-interview{bottom:8%; left:-4%;}
  .orbit-tag.t-interview .tag-dot{background:var(--gold-champagne);}
  .orbit-tag.t-ready{bottom:0%; right:4%;}
  .orbit-tag.t-ready .tag-dot{background:var(--crimson-ruby);}

  .score-core{
    position:relative;
    width:230px;height:230px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  .score-core svg{width:100%;height:100%;transform:rotate(-90deg);}
  .score-core circle{fill:none;}
  .ring-track{stroke:rgba(207,193,165,0.10); stroke-width:10;}
  .ring-progress{
    stroke:url(#goldArc);
    stroke-width:10;
    stroke-linecap:round;
    stroke-dasharray:590;
    stroke-dashoffset:590;
    transition:stroke-dashoffset 1.8s cubic-bezier(.22,.9,.3,1);
  }
  .score-text{
    position:absolute;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;
  }
  .score-text .num{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-size:3.2rem;
    font-weight:500;
    color:var(--ivory-warm);
    line-height:1;
  }
  .score-text .label{
    margin-top:6px;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    color:var(--gold-royal);
  }

  /* ---------- section shared ---------- */
  section{padding:100px 32px;}
  .section-head{
    max-width:640px;
    margin-bottom:56px;
  }
  .section-head h2{
    font-size:2.3rem;
    line-height:1.15;
    margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .section-head p{
    color:var(--ivory-muted);
    font-size:1.02rem;
    max-width:520px;
  }
  .rule{
    height:1px;
    max-width:1180px;
    margin:0 auto;
    background:linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--gold-border) 20%, var(--gold-border) 80%, transparent);
  }

  /* ---------- how it works (sequence) ---------- */
  .flow{
    max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;
    position:relative;
  }
  .flow-track{
    position:relative;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
    gap:0;
  }
  .flow-line{
    position:absolute;
    top:23px;
    left:10%;right:10%;
    height:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(to right, var(--gold-antique), var(--gold-champagne), var(--crimson-ruby));
    opacity:0.45;
  }
  .flow-step{
    position:relative;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;
    padding-right:20px;
  }
  .flow-num{
    width:46px;height:46px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid var(--gold-border-strong);
    background:var(--wine-sec);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    color:var(--gold-champagne);
    font-size:1.02rem;
    margin-bottom:22px;
    z-index:1;
  }
  .flow-step h3{
    font-size:1.08rem;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .flow-step p{
    font-size:0.88rem;
    color:var(--ivory-muted);
    max-width:200px;
  }

  /* ---------- feature grid ---------- */
  .feature-grid{
    max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:rgba(207,193,165,0.12);
    border:1px solid rgba(207,193,165,0.12);
    border-radius:14px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .feature{
    background:var(--wine-deep);
    padding:36px 32px;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;
    gap:16px;
  }
  .feature.accent{
    background:linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(143,13,21,0.16), var(--wine-deep) 55%);
  }
  .feature-icon{
    width:38px;height:38px;
  }
  .feature h3{font-size:1.08rem;font-weight:500;}
  .feature p{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--ivory-muted);}

  /* ---------- ats deep dive ---------- */
  .ats-section{
    max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap:64px;
    align-items:center;
    padding:100px 32px;
  }
  .ats-copy h2{font-size:2.1rem;margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.18;}
  .ats-copy p{color:var(--ivory-muted);margin-bottom:28px;max-width:440px;}

  .breakdown{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;max-width:440px;}
  .bd-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}
  .bd-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:0.86rem;}
  .bd-top .name{color:var(--ivory-warm);}
  .bd-top .val{color:var(--gold-champagne);font-family:'Fraunces',serif;}
  .bd-top .val.crimson{color:var(--crimson-ruby);}
  .bd-track{height:6px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(207,193,165,0.10);overflow:hidden;}
  .bd-fill{height:100%;border-radius:4px;}
  .bd-fill.gold{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold-antique),var(--gold-champagne));}
  .bd-fill.crimson{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--crimson-deep),var(--crimson-ruby));}

  .ats-panel{
    background:var(--wine-sec);
    border:1px solid var(--gold-border);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:44px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .ats-panel::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    width:340px;height:340px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid rgba(217,154,22,0.08);
    top:-120px;right:-120px;
  }
  .ats-row{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:16px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(207,193,165,0.10);
    font-size:0.92rem;
  }
  .ats-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .ats-row .kw{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  .ats-row .kw .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;}
  .kw .dot.match{background:var(--gold-champagne);}
  .kw .dot.missing{background:var(--crimson-ruby);}
  .ats-row .status{font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--ivory-muted);}
  .ats-row .status.missing{color:var(--crimson-ruby);}

  /* ---------- editorial quote ---------- */
  .quote-section{
    max-width:840px;margin:0 auto;
    padding:110px 32px;
    text-align:left;
  }
  .quote-mark{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-size:4rem;
    color:var(--gold-royal);
    line-height:0.5;
    margin-bottom:24px;
    display:block;
  }
  .quote-section blockquote{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-size:1.7rem;
    line-height:1.42;
    font-weight:400;
    color:var(--ivory-warm);
    margin-bottom:28px;
  }
  .quote-attr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;}
  .quote-attr .line{width:32px;height:1px;background:var(--gold-royal);}
  .quote-attr .who{font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--ivory-muted);}
  .quote-attr .who b{color:var(--ivory-warm);font-weight:500;}

  /* ---------- closing cta ---------- */
  .closing{
    max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;
    padding:80px 32px 120px;
  }
  .closing-panel{
    background:var(--wine-sec);
    border:1px solid var(--gold-border-strong);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:72px 64px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:40px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .closing-panel::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:radial-gradient(ellipse 500px 300px at 90% 0%, rgba(217,154,22,0.10), transparent 70%);
  }
  .closing-panel h2{font-size:2rem;max-width:440px;position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .closing-ctas{display:flex;gap:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;flex-shrink:0;}

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{
    max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;
    padding:40px 32px 60px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    border-top:1px solid rgba(207,193,165,0.12);
  }
  .foot-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  .foot-brand svg{width:22px;height:22px;}
  .foot-brand span{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1rem;color:var(--ivory-muted);}
  .foot-links{display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:0.86rem;color:var(--ivory-muted);}
  .foot-links a:hover{color:var(--gold-champagne);}

  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width:920px){
    .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:60px;padding-top:40px;}
    .hero h1{font-size:2.5rem;max-width:100%;}
    .hero p.sub{max-width:100%;}
    .hero-visual{order:-1;}
    .flow-track{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:36px;}
    .flow-line{display:none;}
    .feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .ats-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px;}
    .closing-panel{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;}
    nav .nav-links{display:none;}
    .proof-row{gap:28px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:560px){
    .hero h1{font-size:2.1rem;}
    section{padding:70px 20px;}
    .quote-section blockquote{font-size:1.35rem;}
    .closing-panel{padding:48px 32px;}
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{transition:none !important; animation:none !important;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="texture-layer"></div>
<div class="grid-lines"></div>

<header>
  <div class="brand">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
      <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="18" stroke="url(#markGold)" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.55"/>
      <path d="M20 6 A14 14 0 0 1 34 20" stroke="url(#markGold)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M20 34 A14 14 0 0 1 6 20" stroke="#8F0D15" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.85"/>
      <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="4" fill="url(#markGold)"/>
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="markGold" x1="0" y1="0" x2="40" y2="40">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#A96708"/>
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#F4C64E"/>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
    </svg>
    <span class="brand-name">Laurel</span>
  </div>
  <nav>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#features">Platform</a>
      <a href="#ats">ATS score</a>
      <a href="#story">Stories</a>
    </div>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Sign in</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero" style="padding-top:56px;">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Built for candidates who read the fine print</div>
      <h1>Know exactly what stands between you and the <em>offer</em>.</h1>
      <p class="sub">Laurel reads your resume the way a hiring system does, then the way a hiring manager does — and tells you precisely what to fix before you hit submit.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Analyze my resume <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-row">
        <div><span class="proof-num">2.1M</span><span class="proof-label">Resumes scored</span></div>
        <div><span class="proof-num">63%</span><span class="proof-label">More callbacks on average</span></div>
        <div><span class="proof-num">4.8/5</span><span class="proof-label">From 12,400 reviews</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="score-panel">
        <div class="orbit-ring r1"></div>
        <div class="orbit-ring r2"></div>
        <div class="orbit-tag t-resume"><span class="tag-dot"></span>Resume parsed</div>
        <div class="orbit-tag t-skills"><span class="tag-dot"></span>3 gaps found</div>
        <div class="orbit-tag t-interview"><span class="tag-dot"></span>Interview prep</div>
        <div class="orbit-tag t-ready"><span class="tag-dot"></span>Ready to send</div>

        <div class="score-core">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 210 210">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="goldArc" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#A96708"/>
                <stop offset="0.55" stop-color="#D99A16"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#F4C64E"/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <circle class="ring-track" cx="105" cy="105" r="94"/>
            <circle class="ring-progress" id="scoreRing" cx="105" cy="105" r="94"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="score-text">
            <span class="num" id="scoreNum">0</span>
            <span class="label">ATS SCORE</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section id="how">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Five stages, one clear path forward.</h2>
      <p>Every resume moves through the same journey before it reaches a human. Laurel walks you through each stage in order, so nothing gets missed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="flow-track">
        <div class="flow-line"></div>
        <div class="flow-step">
          <div class="flow-num">1</div>
          <h3>Resume</h3>
          <p>Upload any format. Laurel parses structure, sections, and formatting the way applicant systems do.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step">
          <div class="flow-num">2</div>
          <h3>Analysis</h3>
          <p>Every line is checked against the role you're targeting — wording, keywords, and structure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step">
          <div class="flow-num">3</div>
          <h3>Skills</h3>
          <p>See exactly which required skills are present, which are missing, and how to close the gap.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step">
          <div class="flow-num">4</div>
          <h3>Interview</h3>
          <p>Practice the questions your specific background is likely to draw, with feedback after each one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step">
          <div class="flow-num">5</div>
          <h3>Readiness</h3>
          <p>A single readiness score that tells you when the application is genuinely ready to send.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURES -->
  <section id="features">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Everything a careful applicant checks by hand — done in ninety seconds.</h2>
      <p>Laurel replaces the folder of tabs, forums, and guesswork with one system that shows its reasoning.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature">
        <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 38 38" fill="none"><circle cx="19" cy="19" r="14" stroke="#D99A16" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M19 10v9l6 4" stroke="#F4C64E" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
